(
 '# Closing an APLGUI form'
 ''
 'The official way to close an `APLGUI` Form is to call the appropriate method which is `n.∆CloseForm`.'
 ''
 'Note that a GUI might continue to be visible; that''s because somewhere it still a reference'
 'pointing to the `n` namespace. Only when the last reference to `n` is deleted will the Form disappear.'
 ''
)
